 **Parameters:**
-*   **Expansion Order ($p$):** The order of the finite series in FMM. Higher $p$ increases accuracy but consumes more time. Recommended $p$ (higher) is 9–12. Recommended $p_0$ (lower) is 5–8 [S1].
